          {
            "id": "ch01.s11.p01.01",
            "text": "What background do you need before the material turns to implementation, and how will the teaching move from concepts into code?",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s11.p01.02",
            "text": "A lack of familiarity with ChatGPT is not a problem, because the playlist builds its own GPT and explains it along the way.",
