            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@762",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@765"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s11.p01.05",
            "text": "To teach from the book in detail, detailed whiteboard notes are being prepared from the book so that understanding can be transferred in an interesting and fundamental way.",
